  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "VPC CNI = Networking",
      "items": [
        "aws-node (IPAMD · ENI Manager) attaches ENIs and assigns pod IPs from the VPC CIDR",
        "Because pod IPs are VPC addresses, cross-node pod-to-pod traffic is routed directly by the VPC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Calico = Policy",
      "items": [
        "Felix in calico-node enforces NetworkPolicy via iptables/eBPF without changing the networking",
        "Running alongside VPC CNI, BGP/IPAM are disabled (bgp: Disabled) — policy-only mode",
        "Typha fans out the API server watch to every calico-node — required beyond 50 nodes"
      ]
    }
  ]
